  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A fuel has mass density <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\rho\"></span> and energy density <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span>. What mass of the fuel has to be burned to release thermal energy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{ρ E}{u}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{uE}{\\rho}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{ρ u}{E}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"ρ u E\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
